        {
          "page": 1,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "A method for predicting fatigue life using damage variables coupled with multi-modal microstructure damage evolution was proposed after analyzing the weights of the multi-modal microstructure of directionally solidified Ni-based superalloys DZ125 in this paper.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "5ff1e9108ac09dd5:part:001"
        },
        {
          "page": 9,
          "section": null,
          "quote": "In common cast directional solidification superalloys, grain boundaries can be strengthened by various carbides.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "5ff1e9108ac09dd5:part:002"
        },
        {
          "page": 15,
          "section": "Conclusions",
          "quote": "The microstructure had a stronger impact on the mechanical prop -erties of DZ125 superalloy was the γ’ precipitates, followed by the γ / γ’ eutectic and the one with the least influence was the carbide.",
